@jedludlow I had an epiphany in the middle of the night that the .copy() command returns to Null, and then the .sort() command which happens in place was happening on the returned Null data.

In other words, the sort wasn't working.

This would have only affected the ordered statistics. I'll push a hotfix soon and ship a new release.
